==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.07~8 seconds<sup>2f~240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.07~8 seconds<sup>2f~240f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Neutralization Type Nimue (Enemy)|Neutralization Type Nimue]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
