**2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
While this Nimue is more powerful than the previous one, it is still not an issue. Her damage output is almost non-existant and she gets outranged by units such as [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]]. Bring some units that can take care of the Dark enemies found here and you will win easily.

